     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/any-cost-2015-11-25"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In a flashback, the young caravan captain Tazri halts a caravan on Tazeem because something feels wrong, and she kills a dying angel and takes her halo.",
    "cites": [
